      "id": 1,
      "text": "Ursa’s first settlers arrived in 1823, laying the groundwork for a small Illinois community that would grow over the next century.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ursa%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The village was officially established in 1828 and didn’t become an incorporated municipality until 1964.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        10
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ursa%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Ursa sits in Adams County, in western Illinois, just northeast of the Mississippi River and the city of Quincy.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        23,
        24
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.citydirectory.us/village-ursa.html",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "It is part of the Quincy, IL–MO Micropolitan Statistical Area, making Quincy the nearest major urban center for residents.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        8,
        25
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia",
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ursa%2C_Illinois",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "location_description"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "The village’s name, Ursa, shares its spelling with a few other U.S. communities, though none are in Illinois.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        1,
        2
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://roadsidethoughts.com/il/ursa-xx-adams-profile.htm",
      "category": "other",
      "quality": "poor",
      "qualityReason": "editorial_filler"
    },
    {
